MuPDF (PDF engine)
------------------

MuPDF is Copyright (C) 2004-2021 Artifex Software, Inc. Licensed under
AGPL-3.0-or-later. https://mupdf.com

PDFLector links MuPDF statically, via the Rust crates `mupdf` / `mupdf-sys`
(version 0.8, https://github.com/messense/mupdf-rs). Both crates declare
AGPL-3.0 in their Cargo.toml; MuPDF's own sources are AGPL-3.0-or-later.
Choosing AGPL-3.0-or-later for PDFLector keeps the license variant identical
to MuPDF's (ADR-001, docs/adr/ADR-001-motor-pdf.md).

Third-party dependencies
------------------------

